customer: retired_accountant
problem: no_sound
daypart: afternoon
brief:
	Exactly the same issue as his first visit: the only duplicate problem of the week.

== drop-off
(neutral) Hello again.
- Back so soon?
	(problem) Believe me, I'd rather not be.
	- So, what's your problem?
- Oh, it's you again! Anything happened?
(problem) It's silent again! Since last night. I didn't touch a thing, I promise.
- Really? Nothing? Not even the volume?
	(neutral) Well... maybe I clicked the little speaker. Once. Or twice.
	- OK, leave it with me.
		(neutral) Please hurry. The tax office won't wait.
		- I'll call you.

== pick-up
(happy) Thanks for getting back to me so quickly!
- Well.. It wasn't really a complicated issue...
- I didn't want to make the tax office wait
- We are known for our swiftness here at CompuFun .
(happy) So it plays its little tune again? Wonderful.
- Pling plong! Good luck with those tax returns and stay off the speaker button!
